From 8355b8da6b2035cd1766b279ff98b3eeb7542af8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Trowbridge <chris.trowbridge@ezurio.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 16:51:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Ignore import errors for optional dependencies

These libraries are not required for offline AHAB container signing
with nxpimage:

- libusbsio, libuuu: USB device communication
- colorama: terminal color output
- prettytable: formatted table display
- hexdump: debug hex dump formatting
- packaging: version string parsing
- platformdirs: platform-specific directory management
- click_command_tree: CLI help tree formatting
- sly: SB2 boot descriptor parser
- x690: ASN.1 TLV encoding

Install sys.modules shims for colorama, click_command_tree, hexdump,
prettytable, sly, and x690 in spsdk/__init__.py so all downstream
imports resolve without per-file patches.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [native integration adjustments]
Signed-off-by: Chris Trowbridge <chris.trowbridge@ezurio.com>
---
